{
  "folder": "slrw8J4BHT24qLkW",
  "name": "地精（旧版）Goblin (GGR)",
  "type": "race",
  "_id": "DpN7RQT1dTWzbmSN",
  "img": "icons/weapons/clubs/club-banded-brown.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><h3><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">属性值提升</strong></h3></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><h3><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">体型</strong></h3></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><h3><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">速度</strong></h3></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>敏捷 +2; 体质 +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>小体型</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30尺</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Age\"><h3>年龄:</h3><p>地精在8岁时成年，他们显然衰老得比人类要快，尽管很少有地精能活到老，他们中最小心谨慎的也能活过60岁。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">阵营:</strong>拉尼卡的地精多数是混乱阵营，而善良还是邪恶并没有特别的倾向。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">体型:</strong>地精大约3到4尺高，体重40到80磅，你是小体型。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">速度:</strong>你的基础步行速度为30尺。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">黑暗视觉：</strong>在昏暗环境下，你可以看清你周围60英尺内的区域如同处于明亮光照下；在黑暗环境下，你可以视为微光光照。你在黑暗中无法分辨颜色，只能看到灰色的画面。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">小型生物的怒火：</strong>当你对比你大型的生物使用攻击或魔法，并造成伤害时，你可以对它造成额外伤害。这个额外伤害等于你的等级。该特性在你完成一次短休或长休前无法再次使用。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">敏捷逃脱：</strong>地精可在自己的回合，以一个附赠动作进行撤离（Disengage）或者躲藏（Hide）动作。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">语言：</strong>你可以说、读及写通用语和地精语。在拉尼卡，地精语是一门过分简化的语言，词汇量极其有限并且语法支离破碎，不适合用于高雅的交谈中。</p></div><p>无论是在恐惧中流泪，在疯狂的笑声中咯咯地笑，还是在愤怒中咆哮，地精都是可怜的、无关紧要的——至少在拉尼卡的其他大多数人眼里是这样。然而，在他们自己的脑子里，他们满足于潜伏在阴影中，直到他们完全进入自己的内心并获得他们认为应得的认可。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">他们有资格获得一些荣誉，因为他们的坚韧，敏捷，狡猾的创造力，和该死的运气，所有这些使他们能够超越那些比他们更大，更强的生物，在这个世界上生存下来。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><strong style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">短小精悍</strong><br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">地精约有3英尺高，浑身覆盖着疣绿色的皮肤，地精有着巨大的鼻子和耳朵。它们瘦弱的身体出奇地强壮，嘴里满是锋利的弯曲的牙齿。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">大多数地精都是秃顶的，无论是遗传还是选择，但也有少数地精夸耀自己红色或黑色的头发。它们的胳膊和腿与它们的小身体成比例地伸长，它们的手指和脚趾也长而细。许多地精喜欢裸露脚趾便于攀爬。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><strong style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">不羁情感</strong><br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">作为有原始冲动的生物，地精在一些公会中发现了自己的价值，尤其是伊捷联盟（他们通常作为研究人员的服务员），古鲁部族（在部落和文明地区之间形成了倒霉的缓冲营地），拉铎司宗派（把他们对爆炸的热爱用到了正确的地方）.偶尔还有波洛斯（如果他们发现自己内心有纪律和勇气，或者发现自己无法抵挡波洛斯人武器和装甲的光芒）。许多地精是无公会的，这让他们沦为了街头帮派的成员。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">有时，受到狂野情绪波动的驱使，地精倾向于毁灭，这种毁灭可以采取一种好玩的形式，但通常不是。有些地精笨手笨脚的，其他地精喜欢把这些笨蛋给点天灯，同时还有一群地精彻底把事情搞砸。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">地精有一种不可理喻的幽默感，通常通过有害的恶作剧来表达。他们中的恶人在别人的不幸中找到乐趣，每当他们被逗乐时，往往会发出狂笑。他们可以表现出明显的随机性，有时只是为了迷惑别人。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><strong style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">地精的姓名</strong><br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">地精钟爱某种特定的声音，地精的名字往往会重复这些声音，形成听起来像废话的词语。<br style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><strong style=\"font-size:small;font-family:Verdana, arial, helvetica, serif;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;orphans:2;widows:2;letter-spacing:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent:0px;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial\">地精名:</strong>Azzinax, Babolax, Blixanix, Crixizix, Dazzaz, Estrix, Finizix, Juzba, Kaluzax, Lyzaxa, Mizzix, Myznar, Nixispix, Paxizaz, Ravixiz, Stixil,Sunnix, Tozinox, Uxivozi, Vazozav, Wexiny, Zizzix</p><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Ability Scores</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Size</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Speed</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Dexterity +2; Constitution +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Small</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30 ft.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Age\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Age.</span> Goblins reach adulthood around age 8. They age noticeably faster than humans, and though few goblins live to old age, the most cautious rarely live longer than 60 years.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Size\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Size.</span> Goblins are between 3 and 4 feet tall and weigh between 40 and 80 pounds. Your size is Small.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Darkvision\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Darkvision.</span> You can see in dim light within 60 feet of you as if it were bright light, and in darkness as if it were dim light. You can't discern color in darkness, only shades of gray.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Fury of the Small\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Fury of the Small.</span> When you damage a creature with an attack or a spell and the creature's size is larger than yours, you can cause the attack or spell to deal extra damage to the creature. The extra damage equals your level. Once you use this trait, you can't use it again until you finish a short or long rest.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Nimble Escape\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Nimble Escape.</span> You can take the @action[Disengage] or @action[Hide] action as a bonus action on each of your turns.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Languages.</span> You can speak, read, and write Common and Goblin. In Ravnica, Goblin is a simplistic language with a limited vocabulary and fluid rules of grammar, unsuited for any sophisticated conversation.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Alignment\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Alignment.</span> Goblins are typically neutral evil, as they care only for their own needs. A few goblins might tend toward good or neutrality, but only rarely.</p></div><p>Whether sniveling in fear, cackling with mad laughter, or snarling in a fury, goblins are wretched and inconsequential—at least in the eyes of most of Ravnica's other folk. In their own minds, though, they are content to lurk in the shadows only until they fully come into their own and receive the recognition they believe they deserve. They are entitled to some credit for their tenacity, agility, crafty ingenuity, and dumb luck, all of which has enabled them to survive in a world overrun with creatures larger and more powerful than they are.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Small and Wiry\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Small and Wiry.</span> Standing around 3 feet tall and covered in warty green or red skin, goblins have huge noses and ears. Their wiry bodies are surprisingly strong, and their mouths are full of sharp, crooked teeth.</p><p>Most goblins are bald, either by heredity or by choice, but a few boast shocks of red or black hair. Their arms and legs are elongated in proportion to their small bodies, and their fingers and toes are also long and slender. Many goblins prefer to go unshod to leave their toes exposed for climbing.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Unfettered Emotion\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Unfettered Emotion.</span> Creatures of raw impulse, goblins are found among guilds that value that quality, particularly the Izzet (where they typically serve as attendants for researchers), the Gruul (in camps that form hapless buffers between the clans and civilized regions), the Rakdos (putting their love of explosions to good use), and occasionally the Boros (if they discover a well of discipline and courage within themselves, or find themselves unable to resist the shininess of Boros weapons and armor). Many goblins are guildless and make their way as members of street gangs.</p><p>Sometimes driven by wild mood swings, goblins have an inclination toward destruction, which can take a playful form but is often anything but. Some goblins clobber things, others like to light them on fire, and many love to blow things up.</p><p>Goblins have an outrageous sense of humor, usually expressed through mischievous pranks. The malicious among them find pleasure in the misfortune of others and tend to cackle maniacally whenever they're amused. They can act with apparent randomness, sometimes just to confuse and befuddle others.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Goblin Names\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Goblin Names.</span> The Goblin language is fond of certain sounds, and goblin names tend to repeat those sounds to form what can sound like nonsense words. A goblin's name gives no indication of gender.</p><ul><li><p data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Goblin Names:\"><span class=\"bold\">Goblin Names:</span> Azzinax, Babolax, Blixanix, Crixizix, Dazzaz, Estrix, Finizix, Juzba, Kaluzax, Lyzaxa, Mizzix, Myznar, Nixispix, Paxizaz, Ravixiz, Stixil, Sunnix, Tozinox, Uxivozi, Vazozav, Wexiny, Zizzix</p></li></ul></div>",
